{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20066","headline":"汴州离乱後忆韩愈李翱 · 孟郊","name":"汴州离乱後忆韩愈李翱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"会合一时哭，别离三断肠。\n残花不待风，春尽各飞扬。\n欢去收不得，悲来难自防。\n孤门清馆夜，独卧明月牀。\n忠直血白刃，道路声苍黄。\n食恩三千士，一旦爲豺狼。\n海岛士皆直，夷门士非良。\n人心既不类，天道亦反常。\n自杀与彼杀，未知何者臧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}